    // Only the liquid bed moved, from the legacy fx_water to the seam-healed 128px set (wrap
    // seam measured 0.00 on both axes after healing) at true native 1:1.
      /* LIQUID SCALE (drop 0801fs). Mike: "scale the liquids down please."

       tile:1 draws the bed at its NATIVE size, and the wide flats are 800x256 -
       so on a 480-wide camera you see barely half a tile and the water reads as
       enormous smears rather than moving water. An earlier drop swung the other
       way (0.18-0.22 crushed a 128px tile to 23px, which was mush), so 0.5 sits
       between the two: real texture, at a scale where the wave pattern reads. */
