    //   bank 0        -> pv2  (level / neutral)
    //   soft right    -> pv3  (angled right bank)
    //   hard right    -> pv4  (steeper right bank)
    //   full right    -> br6  (edge-on 180 twist, right)      [mirror for left: pv1, pv0, br2]
    const pk=_pilotKey();
